  "Scenes.Marblepurification.BadEndDickThatFitsClara.WomanSexToySlowly": "[pg]The woman using you as a sex toy takes things almost agonizingly slowly. For some time she only puts the tip in, and stirs it around her entrance with her fingers while panting in unfamiliar pleasure. There isn't much question that she is indeed a virgin; she quite clearly has no idea what she is doing. Of course, any attempts to help her just get you an icy glare and you return to waiting for what she intends to do next."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.CageDatCowCunt.SayKeepClaraPrisoner": "You say that you're going to be keeping Clara a prisoner in the camp. She deserves to be imprisoned so she'll no longer be a threat to anyone anymore. Marble looks uncertain at you and asks if you're sure she needs to be locked up now that she's been purified. You say you're certain, and your mate nods to you and says that she trusts your judgment on this matter."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.CageDatCowCunt.TakesHourBuildCage": "[pg]It takes you and Marble about an hour to fashion a cage out of logs from the forest thanks to her excellent carpentry skills. You then untie Clara from her bonds and put her into her new home. She'll be in there for some time, but at least you know she won't be able to hurt anyone that way. The purified cow-girl offers no resistance this whole time, and is eerily silent once inside her cell. You do occasionally catch her angrily staring at you."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.CalmMurblesFatAssDown.EnoughHandOnShoulder": "That's enough. You put your hand on Marble's shoulder and she turns to you in surprise. Her body is still shaking with barely controlled rage, eyes filled with pain and anger mixed together, the flood of tears is just barely kept at bay. You tell her to calm down and take a deep breath while wrapping your arms tightly around her body. Instantly her body freezes in place for several moments, then she bursts into tears and "
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.CalmMurblesFatAssDown.HugsAgainstBody": "tightly hugs herself against your body. Gently stroking her hair, you're happy to be a shoulder for her to cry on, given both your affection for the gentle girl and the awareness that you're able to help her feel better."
