  "Scenes.Marblepurification.CalmMurblesFatAssDown.SeparateSeeHerFace": "[pg]Eventually the two of you separate, and you get a chance to see Marble's face once more. While her eyes are red, puffy, and rimmed with tears, they shine with joy, matching the great smile on her lips. [say: Thank you sweetie, without you, I would have been more like... her,] she indicates her sister, a small frown once again creasing her features."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.CalmMurblesFatAssDown.SuggestCheckRathazul": "[pg]You suggest that now would probably be a good time to check on Rathazul, before deciding what to do with Clara. [say: Good idea, it will give me some time to clear my head.] The two of you leave the tied up bovine where she is and head over to the elderly alchemist's side of the camp."
