  "Scenes.Marblepurification.ClaraShowsUpInCampBECAUSESHESACUNT.ClaraGlaresMarbleInforms": "[pg]Clara glares at the alchemist at this. Then Marble shakes her head, before informing you all that, [say: Sorry, we Lacta Bovines can't get milked by hand all that well, the milkers would work best. Don't worry, it shouldn't take too long.] She pulls on her younger sister's shoulder again, and Clara gives one more stomp of her hoof before following her older sister out of the camp."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.ClaraShowsUpInCampBECAUSESHESACUNT.ClaraLooksIrked": "[pg]Clara looks at her sister, an irked expression on her face, making you recall the fights you often saw between older and younger siblings back in Ingnam. [say: Ooh come on sis, there's nothing wrong with getting out a little this way... besides, it will be a lot faster this way, and more fun.] She turns to you, whispers the last bit in your ear then gives you a wink."
