  "Scenes.Marblepurification.ClaraShowsUpInCampBECAUSESHESACUNT.FairIdeaChimesSarcastic": "[pg]Seeming to have a fair idea of what you're thinking, Clara chimes in sarcastically, [say: Thinking you might have picked the wrong girl, charmer?] She waits a moment, giving you a serious look, before bursting out laughing and says, [say: No, I'm just messing with you. Marble's told me all about you two lovers, and I just had to meet you.] Marble certainly doesn't seem to mind the comment, and in fact seems to be enjoying the joke."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.ClaraShowsUpInCampBECAUSESHESACUNT.GetUpWomenChatting": "As you get up, you hear the voices of two happy women chatting pleasantly to each other; you recognize one as Marble, but the other is a stranger to you. Whoever they are, they're clearly getting along very well, and both sound quite excited. [say: Morning, sweetie!] Marble excitedly exclaims at the sight of you coming out of your [cabin]. [say: Let me introduce you to my sister, Clara.]"
