  "Scenes.Marblepurification.ClaraShowsUpInCampBECAUSESHESACUNT.IntonesTakenAback": "[pg][say: Uh, yeah,] Clara slowly intones, obviously taken aback by the elderly rat's appearance. You guess she was expecting something else. [say: Good, could you please give me a bottle of your milk then? I need it to make the formula,] Rathazul informs her. She hesitates for a moment, then her eyes light up and she turns to you and says, [say: Would you do the honors of helping me get the milk our friend here needs? Just don't suck too hard! We wouldn't want you going down the fast path to another addiction, would we?] She chuckles"
