  "Scenes.Marblepurification.DealingWithCowCuntPostPurification.MarbleRespondsKindThinks": "[pg][say: The kind who thinks they deserve the world thanks to a parent spoiling them horribly as a child,] Marble responds. [say: However, you do deserve one thing. Thank you, sister, for giving me your milk. I've been purified now, and my milk is safe for anyone to drink.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.DealingWithCowCuntPostPurification.OneMoreLooseEnd": "Now there is only one more loose end in this whole effort to purify Marble: her sister."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.DealingWithCowCuntPostPurification.PurifyingFittingPunishment": "[pg]As you and Marble were discussing before, purifying Clara would be a very fitting punishment for her. It will forever prevent her from ever addicting anyone to her, and you won't need to worry about letting her out. Of course, she certainly won't like that one bit."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.DealingWithCowCuntPostPurification.SighsSpeaksOnceMore": "[pg]Marble sighs, then speaks once more, [say: I figured you should know at least that, sister, before we decided what to do with you.] She turns to you, [say: Well, [name], you were the one she tried to kidnap and enslave. What do you think we should do with her?]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.DealingWithCowCuntPostPurification.StillLayingTiedUp": "[pg]She is still laying on the ground, tied up next to the firepit. Fittingly, a couple of discarded cups lay next to her, and her tea pot lays overturned at her feet. Your return does not go unnoticed. [say: Finally remembered me, huh? You damn evil people, do you have any idea what kind of a person I am?]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.DefeatClaraCuntInAFight.AdmitDoesntCare": "[pg][say: Admit it, you don't feel like '{0}' here actually cares for you. How could they if they won't drink your milk? You're a Lacta Bovine, giving your milk is the most important thing in the world to you. This isn't love. Without {1} actually being addicted to you, it's just a one sided infatuation. I was doing you a favor by taking [him] away from you.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.DefeatClaraCuntInAFight.AskFirstHusband": "[pg]Tentatively you ask what Clara means by first husband?"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.DefeatClaraCuntInAFight.BelongTogether": "[pg][say: There, you see? Now I'm sure you understand why me and [name] here belong toogether. I won't deny the proper order of things, and I'll make sure that [he] leads a fulfilling life as my milk slave. [He]'ll even be my first husband!]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.DefeatClaraCuntInAFight.BurstsLaughingSaveWorld": "[pg]At this Clara bursts out laughing, [say: Oh, and save the world I take it? This [race]? Don't be ridiculous.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.DefeatClaraCuntInAFight.ClaraFinallyGettingIt": "[pg][say: Finally you're getting it. Damn it sis, I can't believe that it took you this long to realize it. Mom used threats on dad to get him to do what she wanted all the time. I mean seriously, don't you feel an incredible urge to nurse people? Find a good mate and get them addicted to you?] Clara leans forward, [say: Tell me, did you ever consider starting a loving relationship with someone who didn't nurse from you?]"
