  "Scenes.Marblepurification.DefeatClaraCuntInAFight.CorruptInstinctsTellUs": "[pg][say: No, that's what our corrupt instincts tell us,] the lacta bovine you care for starts quietly. [say: Love is caring about someone, and being cared about in turn. It means that you're willing to change for the benefit of who you love.] The strength of her voice grows, [say: Forcing what you think is your perfect mate onto someone isn't love. That's slavery. That's evil.]"
