  "Scenes.Marblepurification.DefeatClaraCuntInAFight.ScoffsHaventListened": "[pg]The younger cow-girl scoffs, [say: Haven't you been listening to me sis? [He]'ll be addicted to me. That. Is. Love. How else can you show just how much you care?]"
