  "Scenes.Marblepurification.DefeatClaraCuntInAFight.ShadowCrossesFace": "[pg][say: Well, that might be true, but there is more to it than that,] a shadow crosses over Marble's face for a moment before she says softly, [say: Even if it hurts me.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.DefeatClaraCuntInAFight.ShakingGettingWorse": "[pg][say: What? That can't be right...] Marble's shaking is getting worse."
