  "Scenes.Marblepurification.DefeatClaraCuntInAFight.WorriedOthersDragClara": "Worried about the others, you head out of the cellar and drag Clara and her things with you. Thanks to the strange way that travel works in this world, it doesn't take you long to find your way back to camp. You catch your followers there just before they head out to go looking for you and dump your would be kidnaper before them. Marble steps up next to you and looks down at her sister."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.DefeatClaraCuntInAFight.YesStupidSis": "[pg][say: YES HE WAS! What are you, stupid sis? I can't believe you don't even remember the big argument that Mom and Dad got in when you asked to be trained how to fight. 'Battle is no place for a woman,' Dad went on and on about, 'there was no way he'd train a girl.' Well, a few hours of withdrawal shut up that little rebellion. Mom even watched him during your sessions to make absolutely sure he didn't skimp up or seriously hurt you.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.DontPurifyClara.BuildCageKeepEye": "[pg]You guess you could also build a cage in the camp if you really want to keep an eye on her yourself. That will make her another mouth to feed, and you'll have to hear her ranting every day. Still, the saying does go, \"keep your enemies closer.\""
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.DontPurifyClara.EspeciallyGenerousLetGo": "[pg]If you're feeling especially generous, you could just let her go, with not more than a promise to never come back or try to kidnap you again."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.DontPurifyClara.OfferMercyKeepCorruption": "No, you'll offer her the mercy of letting her keep her precious corruption. Marble tells you she will respect your decision on that matter. Now the question is what to do with her."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.DumbshitCowCuntsTryToDrugYouBecauseTheyreCunts.KettleWhistles": "[pg]A moment later the kettle Clara has on the fire starts to let out a high pitched whistling noise and is removed with an exclamation of, [say: It's ready!] The younger sibling stands up and looks around, before turning to you and asking if everyone is here. When you nod in the affirmative, she smiles and starts pouring cups and handing them out."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.DumbshitCowCuntsTryToDrugYouBecauseTheyreCunts.ReturnCenterAnnoyedMarble": "Upon returning to the center of activity, you find a rather annoyed looking Marble sitting off to the side while Clara busies herself with a large number of cups from her pack. Curious over what happened, you sit down next to Marble while watching Clara check the temperature of the pot. After a moment, you ask your bovine lover why she is just watching. [say: After I got the fire started, Clara insisted that I'd get in the way and ruin the tea if I tried to help,] she grumbles in annoyance."
