  "Scenes.Marblepurification.FightCowCuntAfterBeingTotesMcGoatsDrugged.ReadyToFightFree": " and get ready to fight to free yourself from this mad milkmaid's mammaries. Realizing your intentions, Clara's face turns from a crazed grin to an angry glare. With barely contained fury, she screams at you, [say: Oh don't you worry darling, I will <b>make</b> you love drinking my milk!] before standing up, hefting a nasty looking heavy mace, and charging at you."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.FightCowCuntAfterBeingTotesMcGoatsDrugged.SteelYourself": "You steel yourself, "
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.FinalBadEndWithCowCunt.ClaraGrownYears": "[pg]Clara has grown in the years since she came into possession of you, through multiple pregnancies and two more slaves. Her breasts are now easily into the I cup range, and her hips have widened considerably. Vanity is certainly something that she has grown into with her newfound power. What hasn't changed, are her crazed gaze and wicked smile. <i>Everything about her is more beautiful and wonderful, you only wish to dedicate yourself even more as she grows more lovely!</i>"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.FinalBadEndWithCowCunt.CoomeHereMilkSlave": "[pg][say: Coome here milk slave. Beg for your sustenance and maybe I will indulge you,] she says with a dismissive wave. With reluctance (<i>reverence</i>) you get down on the ground in front of her, <i>it feels right to acknowledge your superior</i>. After several minutes of postulating yourself, the voice of the vane and voluptuous woman above you calls out once more, [say: Goood, speak now [name].] Turning your head up, with great hesitance (<i>eagerness!</i>) you recite the same demeaning words you have said every day for the last several years."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.FinalBadEndWithCowCunt.DestinationClearing": "[pg]You come to your destination: a clearing in the woods. The familiar structure of a two story cottage comes into view through the foliage, one that all those years ago you, Tim, and Sam built for your loving wife. The structure has undergone some upgrades since then, mind you. It didn't have a second story originally, but the mistress of the \"castle\" hasn't requested any more changes, so its current state of being has lasted for over a year. You've had plenty of time to get attached to the current look. Sam's pretty happy about that too, since renovations usually mean that the garden has to be relocated... again."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.FinalBadEndWithCowCunt.FinallyTurnsSatisfaction": "[pg]Finally Clara turns to look at you. Brimming with satisfaction, she opens up her dress and commands you to drink of her breast. Satisfying your need goes much the same way it has every day. <i>Milk, sweet delicious milk, need, need, need. Must serve mistress.</i> You can't really control yourself, you <i>NEED! Service, am I doing things right? I will please you</i> damn slavedriver. <i>Most wonderful lady! Please forgive my insolent thoughts. Need, need, NEED!</i>"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.FinalBadEndWithCowCunt.FinishedDrinkingLieDown": "[pg]Once you've finished drinking, mistress directs you to lie down on her bed. She wants to use you for her pleasure. As always, you're happy to comply. Just as things have been for so long, she mounts your custom prepared equipment: a kitty cock, 9 by 1.6 inches. You are just happy that you can serve as her sex toy so well. It fills you with such joy to watch the body of the most beautiful woman in the world bounce on top of yours, in that fine dress with her chest still exposed and tumbling around above you."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.FinalBadEndWithCowCunt.FriendlyFoxStrawberries": "[pg]Speaking of that friendly fox, there he is now; picking some strawberries and potatoes for supper. You call out to him in greeting and head over to have a more personal talk. [say: Hey there [name], afternoon!] a broad smile accompanies this declaration, it's always a friendly face from him. Sam gets up and dusts off the day's dirt, then takes a look at the bounty to be served as the main course of tonight's meal. [say: Hot damn! Is that a turkey you've got there?] At your nod, it looks almost like his face would split in two with the way he's grinning. [say: Well, don't let me keep you. Get that bird to Tim right away!] Nodding once more to your fellow, you continue onward."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.FinalBadEndWithCowCunt.LifeReducedMilkSlave": "[pg]This is your life now. Reduced to the milk addicted slave of a Lacta Bovine, you have abandoned your mission just to serve and be used for the rest of your life."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.FinalBadEndWithCowCunt.MistressGoddessServe": "[pg][say: My mistress, my goddess. I exist to serve you. My life is yours, your milk is my life. I shall debase myself to the lowest of the lows, or overcome the mightiest of the mighty should you command it. Please take pity on this one who is unworthy, and grant to me my lifeblood.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.FinalBadEndWithCowCunt.PatFelineHead": "[pg]You give the small feline a pat on the head. He shouldn't worry too much right now, we're actually in good shape today. That cute face perks up, [say: You're right [name]. I'm sure you'll be able to figure something out anyway, that's why you're the first husband.] That certainly is true. There is no way you could ever let down your loved ones, especially your mistress. You wash up, and go up stairs. She will want to see you before supper. She always does."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.FinalBadEndWithCowCunt.SecondFloorLanding": "[pg]There isn't a whole lot to the second floor, other than a small landing at the top of the stairs, and the door to your mistress's bedroom. A small chill runs down your spine as you raise your hand and knock on the door while calling out who it is. [say: Back then? Come in, first husband. I want to satisfy myself on you.] You were afraid of that. <i>No you weren't, you love satisfying your mistress!</i>"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.FinalBadEndWithCowCunt.StruggleFearfulJoyful": "[pg]Even as the struggle in your mind to decide whether to feel fearful or joyful continues, you reflexively open the door and enter into <i>her</i> bedroom. It's a large room with several wardrobes and jewelry boxes scattered around the walls of the room. One wall is dominated by a massive vanity with three mirrors, though it rarely gets much use save for putting on necklaces and earrings. Of course, the main feature of the room is the grand bed set up on the back wall. It's easily ten feet by ten feet in size, and it's upon this that your white haired and cruel (<i>beautiful</i>) eyed owner lounges; busying herself admiring the many facets of her fineries and bodily adornments."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.FinalBadEndWithCowCunt.TimidVoiceCalls": "[pg][say: Sam, that you? Is [name] back with something?] a timid voice calls out when you let yourself through the cottage door. You reply by asking him to come and see for himself. A short, slim, feline male comes racing into the room. Catching sight of just what something you brought back was, a look of amazement crosses his face. [say: Woah, now that's a catch! I'm glad to see you managed to get something this time, the girls won't stop asking for something other than veggies...] You move into the kitchen with him, while two excited cow-girls come clopping out. If things get really bad, you'll have to start harvesting tainted meat. Tim grimaces, [say: I'm not looking forward to that, I kinda like having kids that actually stay as kids right now.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.FinalBadEndWithCowCunt.WalkingForestedPath": "[pg]You're walking along a forested path, the latest catches from your snares slung over your shoulder. Today was a good day. There should be plenty of meat for Tim to make a good meal for all of you, plus leftovers to last for at least several days. No doubt that Sam will be especially happy to see you got his favorite; wild turkey. It has been getting harder and harder to find good game these days with the increasing levels of corruption. That isn't to say that the forest was ever free of it, but it has definitely been getting worse since you ended your quest."
