  "Scenes.Marblepurification.GiveMarblePureQuestLabova.NipplesSprayMilkEverywhere": " nipples begin spray milk everywhere - you have to take a step back to avoid being squirted yourself. Finally, Marble's breasts stop their spraying, leaving the two of you standing in a milky puddle of mud. The cow-girl pulls her shirt back on over her body. [say: That stuff still tastes vile, but I guess it's worth it. I just hope it finishes working soon,] she tells you. You assure her that you believe in her ability to get through this, and then head back to the main part of your camp."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.GiveMarblePureQuestLabova.NotSureCorruptionWashes": "[pg][say: Well... I'm not really sure; I mean, corruption isn't something that just washes off like old grease. The demons wouldn't have the world over a ledge if it was that easy to undo.] The cow-girl tells you. She rubs her lower lip thoughtfully. [say: ...I suggest you go and speak to Rathazul; he might have an idea.] Marble shrugs as she finishes. You digest this information, promise to look into it, and then walk away, leaving her to her musings."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.GiveMarblePureQuestLabova.PassBottleChugs": "[pg]Without ceremony, you pass the bottle of purified LaBova to Marble, who chugs it down. You wait for the usual reaction, but, to your surprise, nothing happens. You ask the cow-girl if she feels all right."
