  "Scenes.Marblepurification.HighIntelligenceCallClaraOut.AmilySnarlsSavage": "[pg]Snarling with a surprisingly savage expression for such a normally meek mouse, Amily whips out her familiar blowgun and loads it with a dart from somewhere about her person, falling back to ensure she is a safe distance for firing."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.HighIntelligenceCallClaraOut.ClaraAdvancesMace": "[pg]Clara starts to advance on you with her mace out, and eyes in rage, but hesitates when she realizes that other guests to the tea party have stood up as well, and readied their weapons."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.HighIntelligenceCallClaraOut.ClaraVisiblyShaken": "[pg]At this point, Clara seems visibly shaken, and just keeps looking between the confused and suspicious glances she is getting. [say: DAMN IT!] she shrieks as she drops Marble's cup to the ground. The recipient of the fine tea cries out in surprise as well, before trying to catch the falling cup. Clara sees this as an opportunity and decides to draw a heavy looking mace. She winds up with that blunt weapon and bashes your bovine lover over the head, hard, before Marble has a chance to respond to your warning."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.HighIntelligenceCallClaraOut.CowSnarlsStandUp": "[pg][say: Little bitch!] The cow-girl snarls, standing up to her full impressive height. [say: I will teach you not to try something like this again.] Isabella grabs her shield and brandishes it prominently, ready to use it for defense and to bludgeon."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.HighIntelligenceCallClaraOut.HelGrowlsScimitar": "[pg][say: You bitch, you'll pay for that,] Hel growls, drawing the scimitar from her hip and leveling it right at the woman in defiant challenge."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.HighIntelligenceCallClaraOut.JojoRisesGround": "[pg][say: I wouldn't have done that if I were you,] Jojo says, rising off the ground and retrieving his staff. Falling into a combat pose, his face contorts into an almost uncharacteristic visage of anger directed at the woman before you."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.HighIntelligenceCallClaraOut.KihaSpitsFlames": "[pg]The dragon-girl Kiha wastes no time; unceremoniously spitting flames and swinging her axe with murderously brutal intent, radiating threat even as she waits for the moment to spring into attack."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.HighIntelligenceCallClaraOut.MarbleDownYourOwn": "[pg]With Marble down for the count, it looks like you're on your own for this fight."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.HighIntelligenceCallClaraOut.RipsShirtAdvances": "[pg]Clara rips open her shirt and starts to advance on you with her mace out, eyes in rage. You stand up yourself and ready for a fight."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.HighIntelligenceCallClaraOut.StandUpReadyWeapon": "[pg]You stand up as well and ready your [weapon], since even with such opposition it looks like the mad cow-girl still plans on fighting you. A few minutes and bruises later, her beaten body proves this to have been a bit of a mistake on her part."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.HighIntelligenceCallClaraOut.StopClaraAskWhy": "You stop Clara when she goes to hand Marble a cup and calmly ask her why she hasn't given herself a cup too? [say: Oh, I uh,] she stutters uncertainly. You continue to push her and ask what the vial of extra fluid she added to the pot was just after she finished. [say: Uh, just some special flavoring!] comes out in a nervous exclamation."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.HighIntelligenceCallClaraOut.StunnedSilenceMarbleFalls": "[pg]There is a stunned silence as Marble falls to the ground, and for a few moments afterwards. The perpetrator turns her gaze to you with a crazed look in her eye, before yelling, [say: It didn't have to be this way! No one would have had to have been hurt if you'd just drank your tea quietly and come away with me, but no, you just had to be too smart for your own damn good.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.HighIntelligenceOutcomesVsCowCuntDrugs.DecisionTimeCallOut": "[pg]Decision time: are you going to call her out on her strange behavior in front of "
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.HighIntelligenceOutcomesVsCowCuntDrugs.JustNotDrinkDrink": ", just not drink any tea yourself, or drink it anyway?"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.HighIntelligenceOutcomesVsCowCuntDrugs.MarbleWord": "Marble"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.HighIntelligenceOutcomesVsCowCuntDrugs.ObviousUpToSomething": "It is obvious to you that Clara is up to something; she's been behaving oddly every time she's spoken to you, and this sharing of tea seems even odder. You carefully watch as she counts up cups and starts pouring them out, then starts handing them out. You also notice that her ingredients also included something from outside her tea kit."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.HighIntelligenceOutcomesVsCowCuntDrugs.YourFollowersWord": "your followers"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.LactaidForPureMurble.HandBottleLactaid": "You hand Marble a bottle of lactaid, and ask her to drink it. She nods to you and brings the flask to her lips. [say: Doesn't taste too bad. Ooo!] she cries out in surprise, then lets out a sensual moan and starts caressing and playing with her bovine breasts through her top. She tweaks her nipples, and squeezes the tit flesh in earnest, then lets out one long sigh that sounds almost like a moo. [say: I might have just had a small tit orgasm there...] She shakes her head and focuses on you again. [say: Sweetie, I think that just filled up my breasts with a lot of milk. I have plenty now, if you're interested...]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.LetCorruptCowCuntGo.ReallyLetMeGo": "[pg][say: Really? After all that, you're just going to let me go? Fine. I promise to never return or bother any of you ever again.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.LetCorruptCowCuntGo.ReleaseBondsEscortCamp": "[pg]You release her from her bonds, give her her things, and escort her from the camp. She gives you a wicked smile, then steps out of the camp and warps away. You hope that wasn't a mistake."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.LetCorruptCowCuntGo.SayLetPromiseNever": "You say that you're going to let Clara go, but she has to promise to never return, bother you or anyone in your camp ever again. Marble gives you a look of shock and asks if you're absolutely certain you want to do that. When you give her the affirmative, she sighs and says that she'll trust your judgment on this matter."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.LetGoOfMarblesCowCuntSister.SayFreeGoPromise": "You say that now that Clara is no danger to anyone any more, she is free to go, so long as she promises to never bother you or your followers again. Marble nods at this and says she agrees with your decision."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.LetGoOfMarblesCowCuntSister.UntieGiveThingsEscort": "[pg]You and Marble untie Clara from her bonds, give her her things, and escort her out of the camp. She doesn't even look at either of you until she is at the edge and you tell her to leave and never come back. She gives you one look, a look of pure rage and anger, of one who is swearing vengeance, then as soon as it started, it is over. She steps out of the camp, and warps away into the world."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.LoseToClara.BodyGivesOutStrain": "Your body gives out from the strain, and you fall to the ground. The last thing you hear before you pass out, is Clara's triumphant laughter."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.LoseToClara.CantFightItMasturbate": "You just can't fight it anymore, and desperately start to masturbate in front of Clara. Laughing triumphantly, Clara walks up to you and forces a pill down your throat. A moment later, you pass out."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.LoseToClara.CompletelyNaked": "You're completely naked."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.LoseToClara.DreamOddDistorted": "You dream of odd things, distorted images that you called out for help to. Then you were dragged away. You kept seeing more shapes that felt familiar and important somehow, but you couldn't focus on them. You'd call again and again, only to be dragged away by something else again. Eventually your cries for help become weaker and halfhearted; you know what's going to happen next, so why bother? Suddenly you realize that it is a cow-girl that is dragging you away; her face looks like Marble's at first, then it splits into a huge, wicked smile, and you panic."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.LoseToClara.EnclosedStoneCellar": "[pg]It looks like you're in an enclosed building with stone walls, similar to a cellar. Given the amount of dust around the walls, this place hasn't been used in a long time. There is one entrance to the room. It's a hallway that turns a corner just outside the room and moves beyond your view. You were lying down on a bedroll, "
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.LoseToClara.FindNotWearingArmor": " You also find that you aren't wearing your [armor], and your [weapon] is nowhere to be seen. "
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.LoseToClara.GreatEffortOpenEyes": "[pg]With great effort, you open your eyes. You feel incredibly weak, and the desire to go back to sleep is almost overpowering. It doesn't help that your head is spinning like a top, but the adrenalin rush from your recent nightmare allows you to force back the lethargy and drag yourself up off the ground and take in your surroundings."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.LoseToClara.JustYourSizeWord": "just your size."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.LoseToClara.MuchTooBigWord": "much too big for you."
