  "Scenes.Marblepurification.LoseToClara.PlainSlimTwoPiece": "Instead a plain but rather slim form fitting two piece garb adorns your body. Whoever dressed you in that definitely wanted your bodily assets to be fully visible to anyone looking at you."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.LoseToClara.WayTooSmallWord": "way too small for your stature."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.LosingToCowCuntsPageII.AsCueCaptor": "[pg]Almost as if on cue, you feel her presence getting closer to you, and your captor steps inside the room. [say: Ah, yoour awake then?] she coos, [say: Feeling up for some milk, I hope?] You can't help yourself, you need that milk, so you nod. [say: Goood, keeping you asleep for a while loooks like it was the right chooice.] She laughs uproariously."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.LosingToCowCuntsPageII.ConfusedMarbleResearched": "[say: Confused? That was one of the things Marble found out when she was researching the nature of her addiction. She said she didn't want to trouble you with that knowledge, but I don't see why.] "
