  "Scenes.Marblepurification.LosingToCowCuntsPageII.LeansDownFace": "[pg]Clara leans down and puts her face right in front of yours. [say: I think that if you want to drink some of my milk, you're going to have to do some things for me.</i> Her voice is soft, but the meaning couldn't be harder. [saystart]From now on, you aren't allowed to go anywhere without my say so, and I'm the only one you're allowed to love. Either emotionally or physically. Understand?] You shudder, and think of "
