  "Scenes.Marblepurification.LosingToCowCuntsPageII.MarbleWord": "Marble"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.LosingToCowCuntsPageII.NothingLikeHerSister": "This woman is nothing like her sister, she loves the power she has over you, and loves to show you just how much she has."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.LosingToCowCuntsPageII.OrderingDeaths": "[pg]It feels like you're ordering the deaths of everyone you've ever cared about, but you do nod your head. [say: That's not goood enough, {0}. I want to hear you say, 'I love you, I love only you, and I will love only you.' If you don't, then there will be no milk for you.] An exaggerated sad expression falls across her face, and it sounds like she is chastising a misbehaving child as she says that."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.LosingToCowCuntsPageII.RealizeFamiliarUrge": "It is then that you realize with a shock that a familiar urge is welling up inside you. No, it is much stronger than you remember it being before. You want breastmilk. You <i>need</i> breastmilk, and if you don't get it, you'll die. To make matters worse, you know whose breastmilk it is too. Clara, Marble's younger sister, has fatally addicted you to her milk."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.LosingToCowCuntsPageII.TheOthersWord": "the others"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.LosingToCowCuntsPageII.WhisperILoveYou": "[pg]Just barely above a whisper, you say, [say: I love you, I love only you, and I will love only you.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.LosingToCowCuntsPageII.WonderingHowIKnow": "[say: Oh? Wondering how I know about that? Marble told me when she was explaining about you breaking free of the addiction. Unlike her, I'm going to make sure you behave yourself.] "
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.LosingToCowCuntsPageII.YellsLouder": "[pg][say: Louder!] Clara yells, the barest hint of a smile playing across her features."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.LosingToCowCuntsPageII.YellsLouderHugeSmile": "[pg][say: LOUDER!] Clara yells even louder, a huge smile painted across her face."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.LowIntelligenceGetsDruggedByCowSluts.EveryoneHasCupClara": "Once everyone has a cup, Clara smiles at all of you and holds her own cup up to her mouth and says, [say: To Marble's purification and meeting new friends.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.LowIntelligenceGetsDruggedByCowSluts.MarbleHandForeheadDemands": "[pg]Marble puts her hand to her forehead, before demanding, [say: What, what are you doing Clara?!] Clara turns to her sister and with that smirking face tells her, [say: I'm collecting the catch that you decided to foolishly throw away.] Marble falls to the ground as you feel yourself start to slip thanks to the drugged tea. Just before you pass out, the visage of a pretty young woman fills your vision and says, [say: Come on now, let's run away toogether.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.LowIntelligenceGetsDruggedByCowSluts.SipTeaTaste": "[pg]You sip the tea you were given like all the others gathered around. The taste is quite delightful and relaxing, a bit bitter, but it only adds to the effect. You lower your cup and smile at Clara, telling her how wonderful it tasted. Clara smirks and in a husky voice speaks, [say: I'm glad you liked it, my darling...] Wait, what?"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MarbleLeavesThePCOverCorruption.AndChildrenInTow": " , and with her children in tow"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MarbleLeavesThePCOverCorruption.AndHoldingChildsHand": ", and holding her child's hand"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MarbleLeavesThePCOverCorruption.ApproachesSomberPacked": "Marble approaches you with a somber expression on her face, her things strapped to a pack on her back"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MarbleLeavesThePCOverCorruption.MommyWhatsWrong": "[say: Mommy, what's wrong?] The young one holding Marble's hand asks nervously. [say: Hush now, little one. We have to go away for awhile,] the bovine mother responds and turns back to you. "
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MarbleLeavesThePCOverCorruption.StopsTakesDeepBreath": ". [say: I'm sorry sweetie. I tried to warn you, but-] she stops for a moment and takes a deep breath to steady herself. "
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MarbleLeavesThePCOverCorruption.TooCorruptedCantStay": "[say: You've gotten too corrupted, and I can't stay here with you anymore. Please find a way to free yourself from the taint within you so that I can come back. Goodbye.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MarbleLeavesThePCOverCorruption.WomanHelpedLeavesBehind": "[pg]So, the woman whom you helped escape from the grip of corruption, leaves you behind, driven away thanks to your own fall to the very same force from which you freed her."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MarbleWarnsPCAboutCorruption.ComesUpWorried": "Marble comes up to you with a worried look on her face. [say: Uh, sweetie? I'm getting worried about you. You're trying to put so much effort into freeing me of corruption, but you seem to be slipping away yourself...] She looks at the ground, rubs her hands a few times desperately trying to spit the words out. [say: I don't think I'll be able to stay by your side if you keep falling like that. Please find a way to clear yourself of the corruption that's gripping you!]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MarbleWarnsPCAboutCorruption.RunsOffNotBack": "[pg]She runs off, not looking back. You get the impression that she really doesn't like what she just said, and she's desperately trying to avoid letting what's happening to you bother her. Should you really care though?"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MediumIntelligenceDoesntDrinkCowCuntsTea.CantShakeWrongFeeling": "You can't shake the feeling that there is something wrong with this tea, and just consider it for a few moments. [say: Uh, aren't you going to drink your tea, charmer? It is really goood,] your server says slowly, looking over at you with a nervous expression on her face. You start to say something, but are interrupted when you hear Marble suddenly gasp and cry out, [say: Clara, what the hell did you put in this stuff?] before gasping for breath a few more times and falling over."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MediumIntelligenceDoesntDrinkCowCuntsTea.GirlSpeaksIgnoring": "[pg][say: You really are a smart [boy],] the girl speaks, ignoring your question, [say: I shoould have known you wouldn't be so easy to trick.] You make your demand of her once more. [say: Don't worry about them, my darling. They'll be awake in an hour or so, but by that time we'll be long goone.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MediumIntelligenceDoesntDrinkCowCuntsTea.GiveInOrFight": "[pg]It seems you're going to have to either give into her desires, or fight her. There is no other option, and after the episode with the tea, it will be a one-on-one fight."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MediumIntelligenceDoesntDrinkCowCuntsTea.GoneWonderWhy": "[pg]Gone? You wonder, why would you be gone? [say: Isn't it obvious? This is our chance to run away toogether, and not have to worry about old romantic baggage!] she cries out with a crazed grin on her face, [say: You're the perfect milk mate for me, and I won't let you slip out of my fingers. If I have to force you to come away with me and get hoooked on my milk, I will. So don't make this hard on yourself. Oh, and if you try to run, I will kill Marble, that rat, and anyone else you've got in this camp. Now, drink, your, tea.] She pulls open her shirt and then holds up another cup towards you, all the while looking more and more deranged."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MediumIntelligenceDoesntDrinkCowCuntsTea.PassedOutTeaCup": " to see what has happened, only to find that she has passed out. Noticing the tea cup again, you turn around to face the person who prepared it. Clara stands behind you with a disturbing smile on her face. You demand to know what was in the tea, like Marble did before."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MediumIntelligenceDoesntDrinkCowCuntsTea.RushToFallenCompanion": "[pg]You rush over to your fallen companion"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MediumIntelligenceDoesntDrinkCowCuntsTea.RushToOneCompanion": "[pg]You rush over to one of your fallen companions"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MediumIntelligenceReactsToDrugging.DrinkTeaAnyway": "[pg]Do you drink the tea anyway?"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MediumIntelligenceReactsToDrugging.EveryoneHasCupClara": "[pg]Once everyone has a cup, Clara smiles at all of you and holds her own cup up to her mouth and says, [say: To Marble's purification and meeting new friends.] You carefully consider your own cup; you feel like maybe you shouldn't drink this..."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MediumIntelligenceReactsToDrugging.HandingOutCupsStrange": "While Clara is handing out the cups, you can't help but think how strange everything about this feels. You can't put your finger on what exactly is wrong, but neither can you put the unsettling feeling out of your mind."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MediumIntelligencesFightCowCunts.ReadyBattleMace": "You ready yourself for battle as Clara pulls an angry looking heavy mace out and says, [say: Fine, we'll doo this the hard way.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MediumIntelligencesSubmitCowCunts.SighAcceptCup": "You sigh and accept the cup from the cow-girl's hands and down its contents. In moments, your vision clouds over, and you fall into her soft arms. Just before everything goes black, you hear a voice say, [say: Come on now, lets run away toogether. I'll make sure you're addicted before you next wake up.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MurbleShouldGoRunAlongAndGetHerCuntySisterSoTheyCanBeCuntsTogether.FaceLightsTightHug": "[pg]The cow-girl's face lights up in a joyous smile and she promptly grabs you in the tightest hug she can muster. [say: Thank you! I'll be back as quickly as I can, okay? Don't worry, sweetie, I know the way home and I know how to take care of myself.] She promptly drops you and starts hurrying around the campsite, gathering things and mumbling to herself as she plans out how to get back home to get some of the precious lacta bovine milk she needs."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MurbleShouldGoRunAlongAndGetHerCuntySisterSoTheyCanBeCuntsTogether.GiveHandTravelKit": "[pg]You give her a hand, and soon she has a travel kit packed and is heading off: first to Whitney's to explain where she'll be for the next few days, and then to her home across the mountains."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MurbleShouldGoRunAlongAndGetHerCuntySisterSoTheyCanBeCuntsTogether.TellTimeOffFamily": "You tell Marble that if she needs some time off to go and see her family for this matter, it's okay with you."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MurbleSpanksCowCunt.AnotherSmackIsntFair": "[pg][say: This isn't fair! You can't just...] Another sharp smack as the force of a powerful fighter's palm strikes tender tush once more, leaving another red mark across the first. The young bovine cries out, [say: Stop it, please!]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MurbleSpanksCowCunt.DoesntBotherReasoning": "[pg]At this point, Clara doesn't even bother trying to reason with her sister anymore. Instead, a frantic struggle with the tight bonds of rope trapping her begins in a desperate attempt to escape Marble's justice. The executioner ignores the futile display for now and instead looks around the camp for a few moments. Eventually she finds what she's looking for and tears off a long leather strap from one of your supply bags. With a few gentle taps on her hand, the brown haired sibling seems to be satisfied, and turns her furious gaze back to the malefactor."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MurbleSpanksCowCunt.LoudSharpSmackNo": "[pg][say: No! I was...] There is a loud sharp smack as Marble's hand comes down hard onto her sister's unprotected rear, leaving an angry red mark. [say: OOIE! Ooie, ooie, ooie.] Clara whimpers as small tears of pain start to flow down her cheeks."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MurbleSpanksCowCunt.MarbleGoodIdeaBack": "Marble seems to have a good idea on how to punish Clara already, so you just sit back and watch."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MurbleSpanksCowCunt.MentionLookAtSister": "[pg]You mention to the girl on the ground that she should take a look at what her sister found. Those tear filled eyes open wide in absolute terror at the sight. [say: You're, hah, you're crazy!] she manages to gasp out between sobs. Like most of the pitiful girl's comments up until now, this one is ignored. The harsh mistress of the law has come, and that mistress is going to make a bad bovine's bum blue."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MurbleSpanksCowCunt.NotUntilYouLearn": "[pg][say: Not until you learn how much what you did to me hurts.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MurbleSpanksCowCunt.OlderSisterOverKnee": "[pg]The older sister puts the younger one over her knee and raises her hand up in the air. [say: Uh sis, what do you think you're doing?] The hand comes down, and gives a dull thwack on impact. [say: OOE!] The hand goes up once more, then brought down along with another dull thwack. [say: OOE! Stop it!]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MurbleSpanksCowCunt.PicksSisterOffGround": "[pg]Marble picks her sister up off the ground and roughly tosses her onto one of the sitting logs around the firepit. Clara continues to sob and beg for the abuse to stop, but it is all in vain. Marble squats down slightly behind her, winds up, and brings down the first of many harsh smacks against her rear end. Your mate doesn't let up on her punishment until every last inch of Clara's heinous hindquarters has been covered in blue welts. By this point, the wannabe kidnapper and slaver is nothing but a slobbering, incoherent mess."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MurbleSpanksCowCunt.RaisesArmSaySorry": "[pg]The elder bovine raises her arm once more and shouts, [say: Then say you're sorry!] She doesn't even wait for a response before bringing down her punishment harder than ever. The hit is so forceful, that the wrongdoer flies out of her judge's lap and lands a short ways away, face first in the dirt, squealing and sobbing like a small child the whole way."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MurbleSpanksCowCunt.SayYoureSorryGritted": "[pg][say: Say you're sorry,] comes the command once more, this time through gritted teeth."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MurbleSpanksCowCunt.SuggestMoreEffect": "[pg]You calmly suggest to Marble that her hits might have more of the desired effect if they were on a bare bottom. She nods at your suggestion, and promptly rolls up Clara's dress. [say: Hey? What are you doing?!] Your mate ignores the question and removes her sibling's... wait, are those, <i>lacy black panties</i>? Well, looks like the use of underwear is one more difference between the sisters."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MurbleSpanksCowCunt.WhatOoe": "[pg][say: What?! OOE!]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.MurbleSpanksCowCunt.WhiteHairedBottomAir": "[pg]With the white haired bovine's pale bare bottom high in the air, Marble gruffly commands, [say: Now, say you're sorry for trying to kidnap [name].]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.NTRIsClearlyTheWorstFetishWhyWouldYouWriteThisOMG.BeastAwakenedInMarble": "[pg]There has been a beast awakened in Marble, and there is nothing that can stop it. Loud squelching noises can be heard coming from your combined pussies as she roughly scissors you. What is essentially a high speed vibrator seems to be running on your [legs] right now, and its operator's hands are firmly holding your them to make sure you stay in place."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.NTRIsClearlyTheWorstFetishWhyWouldYouWriteThisOMG.CauseSadnessVerbalAbuse": "[pg]The cause of this sadness is rather likely to be from the extreme verbal abuse that a woman red with rage has been heaping at her. [say: What the fuck is wroong with you!? Having sex like that with my mate right in froont of me while I'm tied up! You deserve to be locked away, </i>sister<i>.] That last word is essentially spat out. Evidently Clara didn't enjoy the display, nor did Marble particularly care for her response. The elder sister rises up, and steps towards her sister, fists clenched in fury."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.NTRIsClearlyTheWorstFetishWhyWouldYouWriteThisOMG.DropsOntoGroundLifts": "she drops herself onto the ground next to you. Abruptly, she lifts you up and drops your womanhood onto the member you gave her. Since your bovine mate isn't in the habit of wearing any form of undergarments, her skirt doesn't really do much to get in the way of penetration. A shriek of dismay accompanies this act."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.NTRIsClearlyTheWorstFetishWhyWouldYouWriteThisOMG.DropsOntoLegsWomanhoods": "she drops herself onto your legs, and grabs one of them. Instantly, your two womanhoods are being grinded against one another with great force and urgency. Since your bovine mate isn't in the habit of wearing any form of undergarments, her skirt doesn't really do much to get in the way of tribadism. A shriek of dismay accompanies this act."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.NTRIsClearlyTheWorstFetishWhyWouldYouWriteThisOMG.DropsOntoYouSince": "she drops herself onto your {0}. Since your bovine mate isn't in the habit of wearing any form of undergarments, her skirt doesn't really do much to get in the way of penetration. A shriek of dismay accompanies this act."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.NTRIsClearlyTheWorstFetishWhyWouldYouWriteThisOMG.LetPartnerLead": "[pg]From there, you decide it is time to let your partner lead for a while. She is quite happy to roll her massive melons around your face while you snuggle against the wonderfully smooth skin. Abruptly, you feel the woman whose breasts you're trapped within turn around. [say: The fuck is this, sis?] The voice is spitting mad now. You can hear that it's behind you, evidently someone wants to make sure the audience gets a full view of your sexual escapade."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.NTRIsClearlyTheWorstFetishWhyWouldYouWriteThisOMG.NoHesitationInvaded": "[pg]There is no hesitation after you've been invaded, instantly you're being roughly lifted and dropped by a beast that has been awakened in Marble, and there is nothing that can stop it. A loud slapping sound fills the air with each drop of your hips, only for them to be lifted up and dropped once more. Your [hips] have been essentially turned into a jackhammer right now, and its operator shows no signs allowing you to stray from your place on her lap."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.NTRIsClearlyTheWorstFetishWhyWouldYouWriteThisOMG.NoHesitationRidden": "[pg]There is no hesitation after you've been mounted. Instantly you're being roughly ridden by a beast that has been awakened in Marble, and there is nothing that can stop it. A loud slapping sound fills the air with each drop of her hips, then they rise up again and drop once more. What is essentially a hollow jackhammer seems to be running on your lap right now, and its operator's hands are holding firm to your shoulders to make sure you stay in place."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.NTRIsClearlyTheWorstFetishWhyWouldYouWriteThisOMG.ProperLovemakingNotKissing": "[pg]Proper lovemaking does not stop at kissing. You have to be sure to show a would be thief the whole process. Your partner is already working on that matter through efforts to free your body from the [armor] that contains it. Not one to be outdone, you begin to remove the familiar top that oh-so-often holds bovine breasts at bay. With Marble's melons free, she immediately pulls your head down into the great valley of flesh her breasts create."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.NTRIsClearlyTheWorstFetishWhyWouldYouWriteThisOMG.RackRidingMainEvent": "[pg]After a little more rack riding, Marble decides that it is time to get onto the main event. She uncharacteristically violently forces you into a sitting position and tears the rest of your garments off. You don't even get a chance to pull off her skirt before "
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.NTRIsClearlyTheWorstFetishWhyWouldYouWriteThisOMG.RoughSexShortEventful": "[pg]Rough sex has a tendency to be rather short but eventful. In this aspect, this particular escapade is no different. What sets it apart is an incessant chorus of furious shouting and insults from an extremely jealous cow-girl. It barely takes a minute before a sharp orgasm passes through your bodies, and in almost an instant, it is over. Your sweaty bodies separate, and you get a chance to see Marble's face once more. She's crying."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.NTRIsClearlyTheWorstFetishWhyWouldYouWriteThisOMG.StepForwardTellMarble": "step forward and tell Marble that you think that since Clara thinks your love for one another isn't real, how about the two of you show her just how real it is? [say: Good idea, [name],] your lover tersely replies through her still seething visage and steps forwards. In an instant you're forcibly pulled into a strong passionate kiss upon humanlike lips while a decidedly inhumanly long tongue invades your mouth. [say: Wait, are you two just going to fuck right in front of me?] comes an incredulous voice from somewhere behind the woman you're kissing. Neither of you pay it any mind and continue to taste, devour, and lavish affection on each other's mouths. An angry grunt comes once more from the woman you're showing what loves means to, and sounds of a struggle accompany it."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.NTRIsClearlyTheWorstFetishWhyWouldYouWriteThisOMG.YouWord": "You "
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.NursingFromPureMarble.ArriveLoverTeasesBreasts": "[pg]Once you arrive, your lover teases you a bit by grabbing her {0} breasts through her top and playing around with them for a moment. The bouncy flesh rolls around her hands in a very pleasant manner, and you feel your mouth water in anticipation of the delicious milk hidden within."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.NursingFromPureMarble.DrinkAchesWashAway": "[pg]As you drink, you feel the aches and pains of the day wash away, and new energy fills your body. The strengthening properties have vanished with the corruption and although the healing properties are weaker, they yet remain. The flow starts to slow, and you take that as the cue to switch over to the other tit. A satisfying sigh of pleasure accompanies this switch, and the gentle bovine gives your head a gentle hug, stroking the back of your head."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.NursingFromPureMarble.LeanForwardAnd": "You lean forward and "
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.NursingFromPureMarble.LiftUpCowLady": "You lift up the cow-lady to get access, "
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.NursingFromPureMarble.LipsWrappedTeats": "in seconds your lips are wrapped around her teats, and her wonderful milk is flowing forth."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.NursingFromPureMarble.PureMilkNoAddiction": "[pg]While her pure milk doesn't have the same effect as when it was addictive, you must admit that it's still extremely delicious. The rich liquid gushes out, filling your mouth with bliss evoking sweetness. This time around, the flow's speed is far from unmanageable and so you drink with a steady pace rather than wild abandon. Greedily gulping down the white gold, it soothes your dry throat and waiting stomach. Thanks to the comparably moderate stream, you are actually able to appreciate the pleasant feel of the nipple that your lips are clamped to."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.NursingFromPureMarble.SavorTasteSpecialAttention": "[pg]While savoring the taste, you think that you should give some special attention to the fleshy nub in your mouth, and let your tongue play over the tip. A few flicks and then a careful circle yields a very pleasant groan. At the same time, Marble's hands run across your face and head while she mutters gentle words of encouragement and gratitude."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.NursingFromPureMarble.SultrySmileHooksShirt": "[pg]You're given a sultry smile, and Marble hooks her shirt with her thumb pulling it up over her chest, letting her bovine bust spill forth. The invitation to partake in her revitalizing and rich fluids comes not long after, and you waste no time in doing just that. "
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.NursingFromPureMarble.TallCowTakesSeat": "The tall cow-lady takes a seat on the rocks and you jump onto her lap, "
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.NursingFromPureMarble.TenderMomentEnds": "[pg]Finally, your tender moment with your mate comes to an end, and the last of her milk flows down your throat. You separate, and a small burp escapes your lips. Marble giggles at this and tells you to come and see her again whenever you're feeling thirsty. She should be ready to nurse you again in about four hours."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.NursingFromPureMarble.ThirstyAskForMilk": "Feeling a bit thirsty, you ask Marble if there's any chance she has some milk for you. She gives you a sad look and informs you that no, she hasn't yet built up enough milk for you to have more. Purifying her has made it take a bit longer for her to produce milk."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.NursingFromPureMarble.ThirstyAskMilkAgain": "Feeling a bit thirsty, you ask Marble if there's any chance she has some milk for you. She smiles at you and tells you she was worried you'd never ask, then leads you to a familiar, secluded part of the rocks around the camp."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PageTwoOfVisitingTheRatForMurblesPurification.AcceptBottleThankPeck": "[pg]You accept the bottle and thank her; she seizes this as an opportunity to peck you on the cheek before you go racing off to Rathazul."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PageTwoOfVisitingTheRatForMurblesPurification.FortunatelyMarbleAtCamp": "Fortunately, Marble is at your camp rather than off at Whitney's, and your bovine lover looks up at you hopefully as you approach. [say: Did he say he could help?] she asks, excitedly."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PageTwoOfVisitingTheRatForMurblesPurification.NodHeNeedsSample": "[pg]You nod your head in response and tell her that he needs a sample of her milk before he can do anything. You are about to start looking for something to put some in, when she smirks and pulls out a bottle. [say: I just got back from getting myself milked; will this do, sweetie?] she teases you."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PageTwoOfVisitingTheRatForMurblesPurification.OldLooksUpGrin": "[pg]The old rat looks up with a faint grin as you come skidding to a halt in front of him, and then calmly accepts the bottle that you give him. [say: It will take me at least a day to finish testing this; I will let you know what I find,] he tells you."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PageTwoOfVisitingTheRatForMurblesPurification.ThankHimCalmDown": "[pg]You thank him for his help, tell him that Marble will also appreciate it, and then calmly head back to camp. Behind you, Rathazul begins busying himself with the strange equipment he does his work with."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PartTwoOfClaraShowingUpAndBeingACunt.AcquaintanceClopsShoulder": "[pg]Your new acquaintance clops up to you and puts her hand on your shoulder, [say: Now don't you run off anywhere. I want to make you, and everyone else in your camp, some tea to help start the day. I'm pretty goood at it, so you won't be sorry!] she casually informs you with a laugh before heading off to the campfire and pulling some supplies out of a pack you presume she brought with her. You suppose you might as well wait a little while before leaving, you'll also get a chance to hear what Rath's initial thoughts are on the new sample."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PartTwoOfClaraShowingUpAndBeingACunt.ApproachAmilyTea": "[pg]When you approach Amily about having tea with Clara, she smiles brightly. [say: I haven't enjoyed something like that in ages... it kind of reminds me of the old days.] She trails off, looking a little sad, but then shakes it off. [say: Sure, I'm game.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PartTwoOfClaraShowingUpAndBeingACunt.BackCampMorningRoutine": "You turn back to the camp and continue going about your morning routine. By the time you're ready to head out, the girls have come back from the farm, bearing a bottle of Clara's milk. The spotted bovine's foul mood seems to have improved as well."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PartTwoOfClaraShowingUpAndBeingACunt.FinallyHeadRathazulWorkspace": "[pg]Finally, you head on over to Rathazul's workspace and ask the elderly rat if he is interested in some of Clara's tea."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PartTwoOfClaraShowingUpAndBeingACunt.GatherOthersTea": "[pg]Marble suggests that you should gather up the others while Clara is still making it, it shouldn't take too long. You nod, and head off, leaving Clara and Marble at the campfire."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PartTwoOfClaraShowingUpAndBeingACunt.GetToJojoSpot": "[pg]When you get to Jojo's meditation spot and ask him if he is interested in coming to the campfire for tea, the murine monk looks surprised, but nods his head. [say: Tea would be delightful, thank you. It's been a long time since I was able to enjoy a civil activity such as that.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PartTwoOfClaraShowingUpAndBeingACunt.HeadOverRathazulWorkspace": "[pg]You head on over to Rathazul's workspace and ask the elderly rat if he is interested in some of Clara's tea."
