  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurificationQuestFinal.QuiteTheMorning": "[say: It has been quite the morning, hasn't it sweetie?] It certainly has been, but at least now, your lover is finally free of her corruption once and for all."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifiedSuccubusMilkForPureMarbles.AskGrowBreastsBigger": "Do you want to ask Marble to grow her breasts bigger?"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.ArriveRathazulWorkspace": "The two of you arrive at Rathazul's workspace, and find the owner awaiting you, holding a bottle of whitish fluid with gold streaks running throughout. [say: So is that the formula?] Marble asks looking at the bottle."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.CallOutInWorry": "[pg]You call out to her in worry, begging for her to come back to you. After a moment, her eyes go back into focus, and you hear her voice call out hesitantly, [say: [name]?] You let out a sigh of relief and ask how she feels. [say: I feel... different. Like I'm seeing the world for the first time.] You help her to her feet. [say: I guess that makes sense, I was born corrupt, so being purified is something I've never felt before. It'll be a while before I can really give you an idea of what this is like. What I can say is that my mind feels... clean, free.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.ChildReportsSomethingLifted": "child does report feeling like something was lifted from "
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.ConsiderBreastsSeem": "[pg]Actually, now that you consider her breasts, you notice that they actually seem to be a bit smaller than they use to be. Perhaps that was a side effect of the purification process? Well, not something to worry about too much, there are ways to change one's body in this world."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.EachOfWord": "each of "
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.EachWord": "each"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.EachWordAgain": "each "
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.EasilyNoOutwardEffects": " it easily enough, and while there are no outward effects, "
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.GrabsBreastsWeigh": "[pg]She then grabs her breasts in surprise, and seems to weigh them, getting a feel for the change. [say: Can't say I'm too happy about this...] she mutters. Then there is a sharp intake of breath, and her eyes go wide. Her body starts to sway and then fall over. Thankfully, you're easily able to catch her and gently lower her body to the ground. Checking her yields the same wide eyes and unfocused expression."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.GrimacesTasteHandsCup": "[pg]Your bovine lover grimaces at the taste and hands the cup back to Rathazul. Her lips move from side to side, and her brow furrows in uncertainty as the effects of the potion start to play out. As was expected, the first thing that happens is a stream of milk pouring out of her breasts, though not as strong as the ones from the purified LaBova. This one is shorter and more subdued. However, you can visibly see her breasts shrinking as the milk comes out."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.HerWord": "her"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.HerWordAgain": "her"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.HoldsHandOutCup": "[pg]Marble holds her hand out, prompting Rathazul to grab an empty cup and pour a small amount of the fluid into it. She takes the cup from him and gives a sniff of the bizarre liquid, then prepares to drink. You stop her and suggest that she should take her top off so that the problem of milk streams don't come up again. Marble nods and thanks you for reminding her and hands you the cup. She then pulls off her plain top, letting out her massive mammalia."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.LightHeartsReturn": "[pg]It's with very light hearts and spirits you and the father of your children return to report the results of the formula. [say: Excellent! I will be sure to watch them closely to be sure that there are no lingering effects, but you and your family are likely now the first pure bovine-kin on Mareth in a long time.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.MindWord": " mind."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.NowKnowWorksChild": "[pg][saystart]Now that we know it works, we should purify your child"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.OneWayKnowTaste": "[pg]Well, there is one way to know for certain, and you offer to give her pure milk a taste test. [say: Ah, you don't know how good that offer makes me feel sweetie, come on!] You don't need to be told twice, in an instant you're upon her breasts. For a moment after your lips wrap around her sweet teats, nothing meets your tongue. Fear that perhaps Marble has become dry fills you, then, a trickle of flavor caresses your tongue. A new milk is coming out, different from the old drugged stuff that is so familiar to you. There is no mistaking it; it is pure, safe, and delicious. You draw back, smile at Marble, and relay this revelation. Marble laughs, [say: I'm sorry that I haven't got too much to give right now, but just give me a little time, and I'll give you a delicious feast of pure Lacta Bovine breastmilk.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.PluralS": "s"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.RathazulCriesSuccess": "[pg][say: Then good news! The experiment was a success!] Rathazul suddenly cries out, interrupting your heart to heart. Ah well, there wasn't much else to say anyway."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.RenWord": "ren"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.RenWordAgain": "ren"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.RightAwayGive": " right away. Give "
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.SheWord": "She "
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.TakeWord": "take"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.TheirWord": "their"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.TheyWord": "They "
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.TopOutReturnCup": "[pg]With her top out of the way, you return the cup and Marble once again prepares to drink. After a few moments of her just staring at the cup, you suggest that the longer she waits for it, the harder it will be. [say: Yeah, thanks sweetie,] she replies halfheartedly, then sighs, lifts up the cup, and downs the contents."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.TwoDropDoseInstructions": " a two drop dose,[sayend] the alchemist instructs you and hands over the bottle of his formula."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.TwoDropsOfFormula": " two drops of the formula. "
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.WasteNoTimeNursery": "[pg]You and Marble waste no time in heading over to the nursery and feed "
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.YesOneDose": "[pg][say: Yes is it, one dose, and you'll be freed of the corruption from your body. I was surprised at how effective it seems to be.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.YourChildWord": "your child"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMarbleComplete.YourWord": "your "
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMurblesSister.ApproachBoundClara": "[pg]You approach the bound form of Clara and inform her that you're prepared to untie her. She just has to drink a few drops from the bottle you're holding."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMurblesSister.AskForBottleFormula": "You ask Marble for the bottle of Rathazul's formula. She nods, hands it to you and says, [say: Yeah, I think that's the best choice too.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMurblesSister.BuildCageKeepEye": "[pg]You guess you could also build a cage in the camp if you really want to keep an eye on her yourself. That will make her another mouth to feed, and you'll have to hear her ranting every day. Still, the saying does go, \"keep your enemies closer.\""
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMurblesSister.ConsidersBottleCurlsLip": "[pg]She considers the bottle, then curls her lip. [say: What, yoou got something in there to break my mind? Some sort of corrupt juice? Whatever, it isn't like I've got much of a choice,] comes the sarcastic reply. Nevertheless, she does drink several drops without complaint."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMurblesSister.EspeciallyGenerousLetGo": "[pg]If you're feeling especially generous, you could just let her go, with not more than a promise to never come back or try to kidnap you again."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMurblesSister.GivenTriedTakeLife": "[pg]Given that she just tried to take away someone else's life, any right she might have had to choose her own life is probably gone. This will give her plenty of time to reflect on what she's done, and is probably far more effective than any form of sexual punishment would have been. You don't hesitate to tell her this."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMurblesSister.MomentsLaterDrank": "[pg]A few moments later, you calmly inform Clara that she just drank the fluid that was used to purify Marble. Since it was made partially from her milk, it should be quite effective on her. A look of absolute horror slowly spreads across her face and she panics, struggling against her bonds with all her strength, desperate to stop what is about to happen."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMurblesSister.ProcessFinishesSilent": "[pg]When the process finishes, Clara is remarkably silent, and doesn't offer any more resistance to her bonds. Now the question is what to do with her."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.PurifyMurblesSister.PurifiedLabovaWorst": "[pg]Evidently, the purified LaBova did get Marble through the worst of purification. A huge gush of milk starts to pour out of the bound bovine's breasts, flooding the ground around her. At the same time, she lets out a huge, [say: Noooooo!] as the corruption is banished from her body along with the precious addictive nature of her milk. [say: You can't do this to me! This is who I am! You have no right to take that away!]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.RathazulFinishingMarblesPotion.ColorfulEventsUnnoticed": "The rather colorful events of the morning seem to have gone largely unnoticed by the elderly rat. He is uncharacteristically engrossed in the whitish bubbling formula in front of him, so much so that he doesn't actually notice when you and Marble come up to him. The two of you are surprised that he doesn't address your presence at all. It's several moments before you clear your throat and announce your presence. Starting, the camp's alchemist turns to you blinking in confusion for another moment, then addresses you, [say: Ah, [name], Marble. Good news, you two! This will likely be very potent and capable of purifying cow-girls in very small doses. Even those who have not yet been fed doses of purified LaBova. However, it may not be effective on those unrelated to you.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.RathazulFinishingMarblesPotion.ComeBackLaterRodent": "So come back a little later.[sayend] The rodent returns to his reactions."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.RathazulFinishingMarblesPotion.MateAsksReady": "[pg][say: So does that mean it is ready?] your mate asks."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.RathazulFinishingMarblesPotion.NotQuiteHalfHour": "[pg][saystart]No, not quite yet. The process should be done in about half an hour. "
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.RathazulFinishingMarblesPotion.RenWord": "ren"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.RathazulFinishingMarblesPotion.SentencePeriod": ". "
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.RathazulFinishingMarblesPotion.ThenPurifyYouChild": "Then we'll be ready to purify you and your child"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.RathazulFinishingMarblesPotion.TimeToKill": "[pg]You've got some time to kill now, you guess. Is there something you want to spend it doing?"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.RathazulFinishingMarblesPotion.TurnCowGirlAsk": "[pg]You turn to your cow-girl lover and ask her what she'd like to do in the meantime. She hesitates, visibly bothered by something. [say: Actually, I think I need some time on my own to think about what my sister said. Come and get me when the formula is finished, okay?] You nod and she heads off to the edge of the camp."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.RathazulsMurbelReport.AndOtherFollowers": "and your other followers "
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.RathazulsMurbelReport.BadNewsSample": "[pg][say: I'm afraid I have some bad news... while that one sample you gave me was very useful and I do have a prototype formula finished, I'm not entirely sure it is safe for Marble to drink. I'd like some milk from another lacta bovine, preferably one who hasn't been purified the way you have, so I can complete my work,] he tells Marble, who looks thoughtful."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.RathazulsMurbelReport.BreakfastBlearyRathazul": "for breakfast this morning, you find a bleary-eyed Rathazul waiting at the campfire. Marble clucks her tongue and gives him a mug of something strong, which he accepts gratefully, noisily slurping down a mouthful. He takes a seat, staring into his mug, and then sighs softly."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.RathazulsMurbelReport.RelativeMilkBest": "[pg][say: Milk from a relative would probably be the best of all.] Rathazul enthuses."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.RathazulsMurbelReport.TellOkayNotReady": "[pg]Do you tell her it's okay, or tell her you're not ready to send her away?"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.RathazulsMurbelReport.ThenThatsSolutionFalls": "[pg][say: Then that's the solution!] Marble declares, full of cheer. But then her face falls. [say: But it'll take me a few days to get from here to home, and then more to get back. [name], I don't want to leave you here alone if you need my help,] she insists."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.RathazulsMurbelReport.TwoSistersMilkQuestion": "[pg][say: Hmm... I have two sisters; would milk from one of them work?] she asks."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.RathazulsMurbelReport.WakeJoinMarble": "When you wake and join Marble "
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.StayHereAndDontGoGetYerSisterShesABitch.ShakeStillNeedYou": "You shake your head and tell Marble that you still need her at the camp; you'll tell her when you can spare her."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.StayHereAndDontGoGetYerSisterShesABitch.SighsNodsAlright": "[pg]Marble sighs softly and nods her head. [say: Alright, sweetie, if that's the way you feel. But please don't take too long, alright? We're so close to...] she hesitates a moment before finishing, [say: fixing me at last.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.StayHereAndDontGoGetYerSisterShesABitch.ThreeFinishMeals": "[pg]With that said, the three of you finish your meals. Rathazul shambles off to get some much-needed sleep. Marble prepares for her morning training, and you prepare yourself for another day in Mareth."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.StickUnpurifiedClaraInACage.ProtestsCageCantDo": "[pg][say: So that's it then. You're just going to lock me up in a cage? You can't do that! I'm fucking Clara, daughter of Hana! You can't just throw me in a damn cage!] Despite her protests, she can't offer any real resistance, bound as she is."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.StickUnpurifiedClaraInACage.SayKeepClaraPrisoner": "You say that you're going to be keeping Clara a prisoner in the camp. She deserves to be imprisoned so she'll be no threat to anyone anymore. Marble nods to you and says that she trusts your judgment on this matter."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.StickUnpurifiedClaraInACage.TakesHourBuildCage": "[pg]It takes you and Marble about an hour to fashion a cage out of logs from the forest thanks to her excellent carpentry skills. You then untie Clara from her bonds and put her into her new home. She'll be in there for some time, but at least you know she won't be able to hurt anyone that way. The bars certainly don't do much to cut out the noise of her taunts and demands, unfortunately."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.TheFormulaIsDone.AnotherBreathSternLook": "[pg]She takes in another breath of air and deeply sighs, then fixes you with a stern look. [say: Sweetie, I want you to know that I don't agree with everything that Clara had said, but some things I can't deny. I saw what you were like while addicted to me, and I know what kind of an effect that can have. It isn't too much of a stretch to think what years of that could do to someone. What bothers me the most right now is that I never actually knew my real dad. No one could really have been that perfect of a parent. All I knew was what my mother turned him into through her milk.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.TheFormulaIsDone.AssureOkayCondition": "[pg][say: S-So sweetie, how is your condition, are you okay?] You assure her you're okay, nothing you haven't dealt with before. [say: Oh that's great, I've been worrying about that for a while now.] She looks at you and gives a forced smile. [say: Rathazul has finished the potion now I take it? You came to pick me up?] Marble starts to get up, but you stop her and grab her hands when you realize that they are trembling severely, both out of nerves and worry. It's in her face that you can see that the poor bovine woman was putting up a front, masking the pain she feels while trying not to worry you."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.TheFormulaIsDone.BurstsBackBreakingHug": "[pg]Marble bursts into tears and pulls you into a nearly back-breaking hug, calling out your name and declaring her love for you as she continues to embrace you. She gives you a deep kiss and you return it wholeheartedly. When she finally lets you go, she jumps down from the wall, giving you a delightful, beautiful smile. [say: You really are too good for me, [name]. I feel a lot better now.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.TheFormulaIsDone.ButSweetieTheThing": "[pg][say: But sweetie, that's just the thing. Do you know how hard it is for a small girl to keep a giant hammer in her hands after it hits something? Dad had infinite patience with me, no matter how many times I screwed up. Mother was always there when we were training, watching. Sometimes when I dropped my practice mallet in a heavy swing, dad would look over his shoulder nervously and lick his lips, take a deep breath, and tell me to keep at it.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.TheFormulaIsDone.CalmlyTellCertain": "[pg]You calmly tell Marble that you're quite certain that she wouldn't have come out here to think on her own for so long if all she was worried about was your condition. There is something else bothering her, something that she doesn't want you to worry about. You're here for her just as she is there for you. You ask her to just tell you what is wrong."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.TheFormulaIsDone.CutMonstersClaws": "[pg]We could cut the monster's claws, you suggest."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.TheFormulaIsDone.EvenIfTrueLove": "[pg]You tell her that even if that was true, her father still taught her out of love and concern. She can't deny that she had some good memories of her dad teaching her how to swing a hammer."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.TheFormulaIsDone.FindHerRuinedWall": "[pg]You find her sitting on a ruined low stone wall at the edge of camp, still deep in thought. It takes a few moments for you to scramble up next to her, and you take a seat just a short ways from her. She gives a hard sigh and fiddles with her brown hair a bit before resuming her long thought. It's not until you tap her shoulder and call out her name that she turns to you with a startled look. [say: S-Sweetie!] she calls out in a surprised manner and looks up at you, eyes lidded with dried tears. You ask if she minds you sitting next to her and she agrees half-heartedly. You both sit in silence for a few minutes before she brings up the courage to even utter a word to you."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.TheFormulaIsDone.ForcedSmileFades": "[pg]Marble's forced smile fades and her features resume the crestfallen look she had earlier, thinking about the right words to say to you. Seeing as there is no other way around the conversation she says, [say: To be honest sweetie, you're right, I'm not all right.] There is a moment's hesitation before she continues, [say: Oh [name], so much has happened in such a short time and it's all that's on my mind. After all the things that Clara has said I just don't know what to do.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.TheFormulaIsDone.FormulaReadyTellMarble": "Rathazul tells you that the formula is ready, so you head over to Marble to let her know."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.TheFormulaIsDone.JumpDownRemindRedress": "[pg]You jump down as well, smiling back, then laugh and remind Marble that she needs to remember that soon, all her instincts will be washed away, and she'll be able to live her life the way she thinks is right, not the way that Clara thinks is right, not the way her mother thinks is right, not the way her race thinks is right. Marble will be living Marble's life the way that Marble thinks is right. Plus, maybe you'll just start a race of pure cow-girls with her? The smile on Marble's face only gets bigger at this."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.TheFormulaIsDone.JustBeforeExpressionDarkens": "[pg]Just before you leave, you see Marble's expression darken once more. [say: I know I want to change my race, but what about the other Lacta Bovines out there?] Couldn't they purify themselves as well? [say: Well, some of them can, but any that already have people addicted to them are out. They'd be killing their mates, since they need to drink the addictive stuff to survive. Plus I don't think all of them would want purification.] You suppose if they warn people and only addict people that are willing, that would be fine. The two of you start the short trip back across the camp."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.TheFormulaIsDone.KnowWhatHappenedNext": "Of course, you know what happened next,[sayend] she sighs."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.TheFormulaIsDone.LooksAtYouPassively": "[pg]Marble looks at you once more, somewhat passively. You swear her expression is that of someone waiting for her execution. [say: So, [name], now you know the real me. Can you still love me?] You reach out to your lover's face and caress her cheek. She then takes your hand and holds it tight against her face. In an instant, her stoicism shatters, and tears look to be on the verge of streaming down her face once more. You tell her that everything will work out; it'll just take one step at a time."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.TheFormulaIsDone.MarbleLaughsBarelyLasted": "[pg]Marble laughs, [say: I barely lasted a few days... You know how it bothers me when I can't nurse you like any other Lacta Bova out there? As Clara said, I do want to addict you to my milk and fully mark you as mine. I want to make sure I'm the only woman to share a bed with you and keep you all to myself. Every day, I have to fight my instincts not to just push you down and force my milk down your throat. The milkers help ease the burden some, but they can only do so much for me.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.TheFormulaIsDone.MarbleSnortsPeopleClara": "[pg]Marble snorts, [say: Then we have people like Clara. She takes the evils of my race to a whole new level. What are we going to do with her? I don't want to keep her prisoner, but if we let her go, she'll just find someone else to addict.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.TheFormulaIsDone.MostTroublingPartMom": "[pg][say: The most troubling part about all this is that I think of what my mom did to my dad, and that I would have done the same thing to you. If you had become addicted to me, I wouldn't have even realized I was doing it either. You would have been slowly twisted into my perfect mate, and as sick as that sounds, I genuinely want that. Almost every part of my being wants that so much. Ever since I was a little girl, I've dreamt of having a mate just like daddy...]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.TheFormulaIsDone.PurifyHerBrilliant": "[pg][say: You mean, purify her? That's brilliant! Goddess knows, if anyone deserves that, it's her. We won't have to lock her up to know she's safe, and she'll have to find something better to do with her life then getting slaves!]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.TheFormulaIsDone.ReassureEvenIfTruth": "[pg][say: B-But sweetie...!] You reassure her that even if what Clara said had some truth to her words, even if she said your relationship with Marble was only a one-sided romance, it wouldn't change the fact that you love her with all your heart. Even if she did addict you to her milk, you would have stayed by her side and continued to love her. You once again tell her it was her you were in love with, not what she could give you, and nothing would change that fact."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.TheFormulaIsDone.RecallClaraRevealedParents": "[pg]You recall everything that Clara has revealed and ask Marble if it's about her parents and her race. [say: Yes, hearing about how my father's addiction was like and the way my mother used it to manipulate him, my race's methods to find a mate, and finally thinking about my own instincts and desires, then it all falls together.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.TheFormulaIsDone.RememberHowItStarted": "[pg]You remember; that's how the whole effort to purify her started in the first place. It's what brought Clara to your camp."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.TheFormulaIsDone.SenseOfDreadGo": "[pg]You feel a sense of dread as she says that, but you tell her to go on. [say: Well for starters, I really don't want to believe that daddy would train me just because mother forced him into it. I've always thought that daddy wanted to train me because he was worried about the dangers I would face on my own one day, especially with the corruption spreading over the years. When I left home, I felt that he was proud of my abilities. The idea that he would train me only because my mother forced him to because he needed her milk to survive is something I would never have believed until today.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.TheFormulaIsDone.UnfortunatelyDidntLast": "[pg][saystart]Unfortunately that time didn't last long and before I knew it I had addicted you. "
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.TheFormulaIsDone.WarmSmileCutestThings": "[pg][say: The day when I met you, I felt that you were just one of the cutest things that I've ever seen. I immediately took a liking to you after you helped me out with my breasts. You spent time with me, talked to me, worked alongside me, and every day my affection for you grew stronger. I didn't think it was love at first, but everyday I looked forward to a visit from you.] You give a warm smile hearing those words from her, happy to know your feelings were mutual as your relationship advanced. [say: I was so happy when you agreed to drink the milk directly from my breasts. It made me so happy to nurse someone like that again and remember the utter bliss I felt from that.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.TheFormulaIsDone.WhenSaidWantedRely": "When you said that you wanted to rely on my milk, it felt like you'd just given me the world. Then, the power I suddenly held over you made my instincts kick in, and I started to turn into something like my mom. When you resisted, it felt like a betrayal, but my love for you proved stronger than that. The day you stopped me from slipping away for good, when you revealed your feelings for me, that you cared more about me than my milk, I felt wonderful, and my love for you blossomed full bloom that day. "
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.TheFormulaIsDone.WhenToldWhyCouldnt": "When you told me why you couldn't rely on my milk, the memories of all who I let drink directly from my breasts hit me all at once, and I didn't know what to think about all that. What saved me was your love. It went beyond the bliss of giving milk, and I thought that it was all I'd actually need. The day you stopped me from running away for good, when you revealed your feelings for me, that you cared more about me than my milk, I felt wonderful and my love for you blossomed full bloom that day. "
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.VisitRathazulToPurifyMarbleAfterLaBovaStopsWorkin.AProblemPotionBrewer": "[pg][say: A problem? Well, I'm not much more than a tired old potion-brewer these days, but I'll try,] the elderly rat responds."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.VisitRathazulToPurifyMarbleAfterLaBovaStopsWorkin.ApproachRodentineAlchemist": "As you approach the rodentine alchemist, you remember Marble's problems and resolve to ask him if he can possibly help you. Once he finishes greeting you, you politely return the greeting and ask if he would be willing to lend his opinion on a problem you have."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.VisitRathazulToPurifyMarbleAfterLaBovaStopsWorkin.ConsideringHisHelp": "[pg]Considering just how important his help has been in purifying Marble, you doubt that you'd be able to get any further without his help, and agree to let him stay in your camp."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.VisitRathazulToPurifyMarbleAfterLaBovaStopsWorkin.ExplainMarbleRelationship": "[pg]You explain to him about Marble and her relationship with you, about the problems you had with her addictive milk and her efforts to cure herself. Rathazul looks thoughtful and strokes his{0} chin. [say: You say you've tried using those bottles of LaBova that I purified for you?] You reply in the positive. [say: Well... I might be able to do something to finish the job... but I would need lacta bovine milk to study first.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.VisitRathazulToPurifyMarbleAfterLaBovaStopsWorkin.LittleTimeGatherThings": "[pg][say: Then let me gather my things, and you can show me your camp.] This takes very little time, and in very short order the two of you have arrived in your camp. [say: I'll set my stuff up while you go talk to your mate.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.VisitRathazulToPurifyMarbleAfterLaBovaStopsWorkin.RathazulStopsYou": "[pg][say: Whoa, hold on there, [boy],] Rathazul stops you, [say: Hearing about your quest for purification makes my heart feel warm again for the first time in years. In exchange for helping you out in this endeavor, please allow me stay at your camp. I'm sure you'd appreciate saving yourself the trouble of going back and forth for each little thing.]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.VisitRathazulToPurifyMarbleAfterLaBovaStopsWorkin.SmileThankReturnMarble": "[pg]You smile and thank him for the information, then turn to return to Marble, promising to be back with some of her milk as fast as you can."
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.VisitRathazulToPurifyMarbleAfterLaBovaStopsWorkin.SpotAlchemistCampLake": "You spot the elderly alchemist's camp on the lake once more.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblepurification.VoluntarilyChooseCowCuntBadEndYouBad.GivingIntoAddiction": "Giving into the desires that your addiction has granted you, you return to Clara's breast, much to the young cow-girl's moans and sighs of pleasure. [say: Ahh, yes, that's a goood [boy],] is whispered in your ear."
}
